# Google TTS for NVDA specific exclusions (per project rules)
# Never commit or package downloaded voice packages or temporary Chrome profiles
*.zvoice
chromeProfiles/
session-*/
runtime/
google tts voices.json

# The bundled Bun speech runtime is fetched at build time by fetch_bun_runtime.py
# (see build.bat / build.sh / .github/workflows/build.yml). It lands in
# googleTtsForNvda/synthDrivers/googleTtsForNvda/runtime/, which the `runtime/`
# rule above already excludes; these entries document that and cover the cache.
bun.exe
bun_version.json
googleTtsForNvda-bun-cache/
bunBootstrap/

